{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">無綫劇集《非份之罪》14日播出的單元《一億殺機》高潮迭起！陳煒與「奶奶」盧宛茵再度上演激烈的婆媳嘈交戲，兩大好戲之人高手過招，令觀眾睇到拍爛手掌。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">劇情講述淑嫻（盧宛茵飾）與帶弟（林秀怡飾）憑蛛絲馬跡尋至悅萍（陳煒飾）的住處，企圖帶走宏智（徐榮飾）。淑嫻一直懷疑悅萍「假懷孕」，於是趁對方帶宏智去洗手間的空檔，偷偷潛入房間搜查線索。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">未料悅萍十分機警，即時識破並上房當面對質，理直氣壯地大聲質問：「你肯定覺得我個肚係假，想上嚟搵證據揭穿我，離間我同阿智，係咪呀？」淑嫻亦毫不退縮，淡定反擊：「喺度扮大肚，呢啲屎橋都出埋，肯定好多衰嘢唔畀得人知啦！我一定會篤爆你，我一定唔會畀你奸計得逞呀！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7adc3c8d-7a51-4007-a70d-aacf1227b8eb.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026ItKz2pb8aL1784083401.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7adc3c8d-7a51-4007-a70d-aacf1227b8eb.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">面對奶奶的指控，悅萍突然瞪大雙眼，一臉挑釁且極度陰險地吐出一句：「你敢同我鬥？」淑嫻見狀隨即推開對方，悅萍竟順水推舟，借意撞向椅子跌倒在地，更摸着孕肚大喊「好痛」。她精心設計這一幕，目的就是令宏智對淑嫻生氣，從而成功離間兩母子感情。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a79323f8-1bc4-41a2-a0f0-539ffd059dc3.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026HClzK2S6C51784083405.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a79323f8-1bc4-41a2-a0f0-539ffd059dc3.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a08839ce-ddd5-4cd7-a6c4-1df5d0e8578d.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026CPe7FHSqy51784083412.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a08839ce-ddd5-4cd7-a6c4-1df5d0e8578d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">這場婆媳大戰成為全集焦點，陳煒的凌厲眼神加上一副「乞人憎」的嘴臉，演繹得「奸到出汁」，加上對手是好戲之人盧宛茵，令觀眾極度投入。大批網民紛紛留言大讚：「煒哥嗰句『你敢同我鬥？』簡直係宮廷劇劇情」「煒哥真係做得好衰格，睇到都想打佢」「佢同Madam啲嘈交戲真係好正」「好似睇緊《宮心計》」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-15T13:19:32.529772+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":557,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}